#     so the subtraction is of 0 — compare cur.x - cur[pp1].x anyway; that is the contract.
#     hg_want_y(r, i) is cur.y as it is. Phantom points are never in the outline.
#   * hg_want_tag(r, i) is the raw tag byte: 1 on-curve, 8 touched in x, 16 touched in y; and
